{
"file": 5,
"paths": [
"d002/f589"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "615f4ec1",
"en_raw": "Causing students' headaches:"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "b0325d49",
"en_raw": "The New Hirumidai site mystery?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "7b90c21b",
"en_raw": "I mean, isn't that"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "1347a66f",
"en_raw": "just the girls' basketball team"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "8af657c1",
"en_raw": "being worked too hard?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "08d99d9f",
"en_raw": "You mean it's just heatstroke?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "a625ed9d",
"en_raw": "I don't know"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "ff6e33a3",
"en_raw": "Anyway, Sanjo is that"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "153a43f3",
"en_raw": "pushy person, right?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "8f658209",
"en_raw": "Just ignore her"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "d019fb90",
"en_raw": "I'll just pass through a bit"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "19d58e11",
"en_raw": "while I'm out on a walk"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "3fcff9dd",
"en_raw": "You're such a softie, as always"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "6f0f4b5c",
"en_raw": "But Sanjo said"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "fa63270a",
"en_raw": "that Sango might"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "983f4456",
"en_raw": "notice something"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "92cd7164",
"en_raw": "Hmm, thanks"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "60bc6982",
"en_raw": "The site's behind the women's college"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "78636d7e",
"en_raw": "by the bridge over the Shin-Oji Line"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "cdc662af",
"en_raw": "But can we sneak in?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "afd69bf1",
"en_raw": "Huh? ...You're going in?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "2c5a6bb4",
"en_raw": "If we don't go in, we won't know"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "a45db63a",
"en_raw": "what's going on inside"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "6bca900e",
"en_raw": "You don't have to go that far"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "786d7702",
"en_raw": "Then Nao,"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "a7606884",
"en_raw": "you're really just walking past?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "524fc0f0",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "202b9d71",
"en_raw": "...That's kind of half-hearted"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "2f159626",
"en_raw": "Why won't you ask anyone about it?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "81813036",
"en_raw": "Sango"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "e797e950",
"en_raw": "Are you okay on that road?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "beb8a4a6",
"en_raw": "What do you mean, okay?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "8c78e593",
"en_raw": "My head really hurts"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "2277a519",
"en_raw": "I can't deal with anything else"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "862e34ac",
"en_raw": "My head's ringing"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "1a430f94",
"en_raw": "You too, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "2ea2cb60",
"en_raw": "Then what"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "56f3ca91",
"en_raw": "I'm the only one who's fine?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "6889a3a1",
"en_raw": "...I'm not convinced at all"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "2ea596b6",
"en_raw": "Kurumi hates that place"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "862e34ac",
"en_raw": "My head's ringing"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "201e2414",
"en_raw": "Me too..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "cd589410",
"en_raw": "Sango, you really don't"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "a88a3823",
"en_raw": "feel anything?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "cbad4957",
"en_raw": "What's that supposed to mean"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "2660a00c",
"en_raw": "Makes me sound like the only dull one"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "ec9a1d46",
"en_raw": "That road is awfully noisy, but"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "e2eac242",
"en_raw": "there's a strange sound"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "67c85b6e",
"en_raw": "A high-pitched ring"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "915639ca",
"en_raw": "Like when you ride"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "e1bd94c0",
"en_raw": "in an elevator..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "b39f359f",
"en_raw": "What is that sound?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "3d775658",
"en_raw": "It seemed to come from"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "29635f5c",
"en_raw": "inside the construction site, but"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "ad8477a0",
"en_raw": "So the suspicious part is inside..."
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "fa8eb9e0",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "e986e882",
"en_raw": "Let's sneak in"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "c605c496",
"en_raw": "Since the old lady is gone"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "feb768a0",
"en_raw": "the guard must go home by evening"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "2a09697e",
"en_raw": "The work stops by evening"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "d031b8b4",
"en_raw": "so let's go"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "f17e8c9d",
"en_raw": "when it gets around that time"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "6d1550bc",
"en_raw": "That was a terrible noise"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "acf84937",
"en_raw": "Shiina, are you okay?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "fcbad6ab",
"en_raw": "My head is ringing"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "de13c0a6",
"en_raw": "Kurumi hates that place..."
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "9d70483b",
"en_raw": "...What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "da7fa8a5",
"en_raw": "Sango, you're really fine"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "3ff62157",
"en_raw": "...I'm kind of jealous"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "8526659d",
"en_raw": "You guys"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "7fe7bf6f",
"en_raw": "are just too swayed by what people say"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "5d4b8c2a",
"en_raw": "But the cause seems to be"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "d5dfb9ed",
"en_raw": "inside there"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "3e3e90d1",
"en_raw": "Nao"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "0d873711",
"en_raw": "should check it out, shouldn't he?"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "693a1a7f",
"en_raw": "That road really gives you a headache"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "aea56100",
"en_raw": "As for Sanjo,"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "6d843a03",
"en_raw": "she should change her route"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "f33155e2",
"en_raw": "I'll tell her"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "c48a0a7b",
"en_raw": "Wait a second"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "3b2e1a2f",
"en_raw": "You haven't even identified the cause?"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "a25f660c",
"en_raw": "It's because of that ringing sound"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "178fe465",
"en_raw": "It seems to come from around"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "91a96d1c",
"en_raw": "the tree that was cut down..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "e4d3100b",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "dd87582d",
"en_raw": "The guard"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "3c2e78ab",
"en_raw": "said the old lady wanted to go inside"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "c641632a",
"en_raw": "right?"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "7416efcf",
"en_raw": "Maybe she knows"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "65b28e38",
"en_raw": "something about the cause"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "80219d6d",
"en_raw": "Nao, you're thinking something"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "0861245d",
"en_raw": "really weird again, aren't you?"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "8ea1693b",
"en_raw": "If anything, it makes more sense"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "a80a9240",
"en_raw": "that the site is releasing"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "eab7e9da",
"en_raw": "toxic substances causing headaches"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "ecacbf28",
"en_raw": "doesn't it?"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "71b34d7a",
"en_raw": "Fine, I'll ask the guard"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "baa20921",
"en_raw": "myself"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "a66c0518",
"en_raw": "I think that old lady"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "7fbeb51b",
"en_raw": "knows something"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "3967a753",
"en_raw": "I want to hear"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "9260cdad",
"en_raw": "what she has to say"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "1255146a",
"en_raw": "Anyway, we have to ask around"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "9322ff58",
"en_raw": "Let's go to the construction site"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "2dc59d7f",
"en_raw": "Hey Sango, did you hear?"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "bb9d7511",
"en_raw": "Construction got halted..."
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "1c34fd1d",
"en_raw": "Huh..."
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "e6471609",
"en_raw": "I guess it's the recession"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "7bcb3982",
"en_raw": "What a lousy world"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "cfbbb805",
"en_raw": "Could it be that tree's fault?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "ef22c05c",
"en_raw": "You heard too, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "1b2969f7",
"en_raw": "That Naruko-sama was a sacred tree"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "25dee1ff",
"en_raw": "It's one of the Seven Gods of Hirumi"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "241cae34",
"en_raw": "So, are you saying"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "e6c22e2f",
"en_raw": "that Naruko-sama"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "b0e3f92d",
"en_raw": "doesn't punish"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "1c0c3f1d",
"en_raw": "the crew who cut the tree"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "d9747c8b",
"en_raw": "but Nao and Shiina, who briefly passed,"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "93fb7c4f",
"en_raw": "get hit by the curse?"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "265c9c46",
"en_raw": "I mean, she's been protecting"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "c8ed3771",
"en_raw": "this town since long ago..."
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "a6fe61ea",
"en_raw": "Still, I'm the only one"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "b0d34f91",
"en_raw": "who's fine, huh"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "8b5eb15f",
"en_raw": "Fine"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "dbaebe23",
"en_raw": "Let's go once more"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "70c4407f",
"en_raw": "If I get a headache too"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "902a9f03",
"en_raw": "I'll believe you"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "b971c58e",
"en_raw": "No toxic substances either"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "76ead6e4",
"en_raw": "...Then what's left"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "c023618d",
"en_raw": "is the noise, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "09c64f26",
"en_raw": "The construction's halted"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "a021e992",
"en_raw": "so it should be fine now, right?"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "941f565a",
"en_raw": "Yeah..."
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "4aced99d",
"en_raw": "What, Nao"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "76d13e11",
"en_raw": "something bothering you?"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "566e5f68",
"en_raw": "I feel like it isn't just"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "aca58f8e",
"en_raw": "the noise"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "2ccb3ab3",
"en_raw": "The ringing sound too"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "bceebb2f",
"en_raw": "came from that tree..."
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "2cda1a03",
"en_raw": "And that old lady"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "4d11a8fe",
"en_raw": "calling it a sacred tree"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "b2a59368",
"en_raw": "bothers me too"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "103d00bb",
"en_raw": "I get it, Nao just has to"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "2023dd16",
"en_raw": "call it a curse"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "939b8b72",
"en_raw": "Then let's find out"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "421687e3",
"en_raw": "The construction isn't going"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "e6583e67",
"en_raw": "on now, right?"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "672e8152",
"en_raw": "If we still get headaches"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "7832461a",
"en_raw": "there must be some other cause"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "6e7c405d",
"en_raw": "Let's go check if it's really"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "1da54e79",
"en_raw": "the tree's fault"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "2aa9e1aa",
"en_raw": "Construction seems to be halted"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "92d82e3c",
"en_raw": "so we can get right into the site"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "c1d17f93",
"en_raw": "It was so quiet today..."
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "ce9ece4c",
"en_raw": "Since there's no construction"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "ed2648d1",
"en_raw": "obviously, right?"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "4f830296",
"en_raw": "So, did you get a headache?"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "de15e21a",
"en_raw": "I didn't"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "4d1c6d97",
"en_raw": "Hmm... but something..."
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "7d16aa67",
"en_raw": "You're so wishy-washy!"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "3b3c72f2",
"en_raw": "Like the noise gave you tinnitus"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "444b9518",
"en_raw": "That's definitely what it is"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "9f654048",
"en_raw": "Hey hey"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "b1036619",
"en_raw": "That tree was huge!"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "a30163da",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "8d3428b8",
"en_raw": "It must have been a big tree long ago"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "5e8ee390",
"en_raw": "That tree"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "25e2bdab",
"en_raw": "Wonder if there are cicadas, cicadas"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "04db4f55",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "90034188",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to go again"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "24280c8e",
"en_raw": "See?"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "20410c9f",
"en_raw": "It sounds like a lame joke, but"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "e42f90ef",
"en_raw": "Blaming the tree is just your imagination"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "941f565a",
"en_raw": "Yeah..."
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "03c8e722",
"en_raw": "Without the construction"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "5da35300",
"en_raw": "it's such a quiet place..."
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "142ca0b7",
"en_raw": "The ringing sound"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "c2d094a2",
"en_raw": "is gone too, but"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "0c9e05e3",
"en_raw": "I wonder if that's okay"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "8f690bf2",
"en_raw": "Are you going to bring up"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "81ec68b0",
"en_raw": "the Seven Gods of Hirumi again?"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "169d2602",
"en_raw": "By the way, Nao"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "9e9424c7",
"en_raw": "is Sanjo still"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "6a8cef46",
"en_raw": "saying she gets headaches?"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "91f57e29",
"en_raw": "Oh, right, about that"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "ced79ace",
"en_raw": "she seems totally fine"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "20d98822",
"en_raw": "She's completely forgotten"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "eecc5263",
"en_raw": "what she asked me to do"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "5ec4039f",
"en_raw": "it seems..."
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "2f42eb53",
"en_raw": "She says this year's rookies"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "4ee0bc80",
"en_raw": "keep up with practice really fast"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "0575e088",
"en_raw": "...I figured as much"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "c62baa18",
"en_raw": "That tree was huge!"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "9f654048",
"en_raw": "Hey hey"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "1a8cf601",
"en_raw": "Let's go see it again sometime"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "c91f5ff0",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Construction Site!"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "caaded0d",
"en_raw": "Is Sanjo still"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "3716b694",
"en_raw": "drilling her juniors hard?"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "fe50e551",
"en_raw": "She was psyched about winning"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "2b14d66b",
"en_raw": "next year's district tournament"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}